  <annotation ref="lc-Pstar" text="The constrained minimum, the point x star y star, where the constraint curve is tangent to the level curve f equals c star."/>
  <annotation ref="lc-gradf" text="The gradient of f at the constrained minimum, drawn in red, perpendicular to the level curve f equals c star."/>
  <annotation ref="lc-gradg" text="The gradient of g at the constrained minimum, drawn in green, perpendicular to the constraint curve. It is collinear with the gradient of f, here pointing in the opposite direction, so lambda is negative."/>
